OL,3,GNEWSANew theatre will be a venue for
OL,4,Aall, say bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses behind a new #16m arts venue in
OL,7,FWorcester have insisted it will be a
OL,8,F"centre for everyone" - after it
OL,9,Freached another milestone.
OL,11,FThe keys to the Scala Theatre have been
OL,12,Fhanded to the charity that will run it
OL,13,Fby developer Speller Metcalfe, ahead of
OL,14,Fnext summer's expected opening.
OL,16,FThe BBC was given a tour inside the
OL,17,Fhistoric building, whose refurbishment
OL,18,Fis nearing completion and will feature
OL,19,Fthree state-of-the-art performance
OL,20,Fspaces.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
